# Deploy with every push

When the user asks to push to GitHub, also publish the live app. Do not push source-only and leave Pages on an old build.

## Required sequence

1. Run `npm run build:pages` (writes `docs/` with base `/aronium-db-editor/`).
2. Stage the app changes **and** the generated `docs/` output.
3. Commit, then `git push`.
4. The live URL is https://aneebji.github.io/aronium-db-editor/

## Do not

- Skip `docs/` because an earlier plan said "rebuild only if asked". This rule overrides that.
- Commit `pos.db`, `.venv`, `testdata/`, or real terminal slips.
- Force-push `main`.
